\title{Transport between charged endpoints}
\date{2026-11-09}

\p{The source covariance identity in \ref{fdip-00J1} describes independent phase changes at each vertex. A [path holonomy](fdip-006N) transports a charged vector between two endpoints. How can a fermion insertion combine with this transport to survive the connection average?}
